; Rotary side touch: o<ferrum_rotary_side> call [dir] [A] [standoff] [span]
; [clear Z] [axis Z]. From [clear Z] it makes a guarded move to Y = -dir x
; standoff, turns A to [A], makes a guarded descent until the ball's centre
; is at [axis Z] (the rotary axis height, so the ball meets the part at its
; equator: tip bottom at [axis Z] - #5410/2), touches in Y direction [dir] with o<ferrum_touch> for up to
; min([span], #3018), and makes a guarded rise back to [clear Z]. Returns
; the compensated surface Y, stylus centre + dir x (#5410/2 - #3032), in
; #<_value>.
o<ferrum_rotary_side> sub
#<dir> = #1
#<a> = #2
#<standoff> = #3
#<span> = #4
#<clear> = #5
#<axis_z> = #6
o100 if [#<span> GT #3018]
    #<span> = #3018
o100 endif
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<clear> - #5422]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [[0 - #<dir>] * #<standoff> - #5421] [0]
G90 G1 A#<a> F#3017
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<axis_z> - [#5410 / 2] - #5422]
o<ferrum_touch> call [1] [#<dir>] [#<span>]
G90
#<y> = [#<_ferrum_hit> + [#<dir> * [[#5410 / 2] - #3032]]]
o<ferrum_guarded_move> call [0] [0] [#<clear> - #5422]
o<ferrum_rotary_side> endsub [#<y>]
M2
